{"title": "Magic Mirror", "pageid": 25511, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Magic_Mirror", "categories": ["Gameplay mechanics"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Magic_Mirror.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Magic_Mirror.png/250px-Magic_Mirror.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1d/Magic_Mirror.png/375px-Magic_Mirror.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/1/1d/Magic_Mirror.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1d/Magic_Mirror.png/250px-Magic_Mirror.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1d/Magic_Mirror.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The Magic Mirror.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Magic Mirror</b> is a mysterious magical artefact that can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Camp\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Camp\">Camp</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>It can be interacted with to change the appearance of a custom player character or a hireling, but <em>not</em> an <a href=\"/wiki/Origins\" title=\"Origins\">origin character</a>. Interacting with the Magic Mirror brings up the \"customize your appearance\" section of the character creation interface.\n</p><p>The mirror does not allow changing a character's race, subrace (if applicable), or body type, nor does it allow reverting the appearance changes caused by certain plot choices. For example, the colour of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye\" title=\"Volo's Ersatz Eye\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye_Icon_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Volo%27s_Ersatz_Eye\" title=\"Volo's Ersatz Eye\">Volo's Ersatz Eye</a> cannot be changed by this method, and the physical changes caused by using the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral-Touched_Tadpole\" title=\"Astral-Touched Tadpole\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cc/Astral_Tadpole_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Astral-Touched_Tadpole\" title=\"Astral-Touched Tadpole\">Astral-Touched Tadpole</a> cannot be undone.\n</p><p>If the player character is <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge_(origin)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Dark Urge (origin)\">The Dark Urge</a> but is using a custom name, interacting with the Magic Mirror resets their name back to the default, \"The Dark Urge\". It can be changed back in the \"General\" section of the mirror interface.\n</p>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Map_Icon\">Map Icon</span></h3>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 147.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 145.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Magic_Mirror_Minimap_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Map Icon\"><picture><img alt=\"Map Icon\" src=\"/w/images/7/7d/Magic_Mirror_Minimap_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"146\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Magic_Mirror_Minimap_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Map Icon</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\">Act One</span></h3>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 176.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 174.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Magic_mirror_(ruins).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Creche Y'llek, Overgrown Ruins and Shattered Sanctum\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Magic_mirror_%28ruins%29.png/262px-Magic_mirror_%28ruins%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Magic_mirror_%28ruins%29.png/393px-Magic_mirror_%28ruins%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Magic_mirror_%28ruins%29.png/523px-Magic_mirror_%28ruins%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Creche Y'llek, Overgrown Ruins and Shattered Sanctum\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Magic_mirror_%28ruins%29.png/262px-Magic_mirror_%28ruins%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"175\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"